### 1. Get all contract counter parties
GET {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties
Authorization: {{token}}

### 2. Get counter parties with filters (OR logic)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties?name=Tech&email=contact&limit=5
Authorization: {{token}}

### 3. Get active counter parties only
GET {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties?is_active=true
Authorization: {{token}}

### 4. Search by contact person
GET {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties?contact_person=John
Authorization: {{token}}

### 5. Search by phone number
GET {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties?phone=255123456789
Authorization: {{token}}

### 6. Get counter parties with unlimited results
GET {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties?limit=*
Authorization: {{token}}

### 7. Create a new contract counter party
POST {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TechCorp Solutions",
  "contact_person": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@techcorp.com",
  "phone": "255123456789",
  "address": "123 Business Street, Dar es Salaam",
  "is_active": true
}

### 8. Get specific contract counter party
GET {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### 9. Update contract counter party
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties/1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TechCorp Solutions Ltd",
  "contact_person": "Jane Smith",
  "email": "jane.smith@techcorp.com",
  "phone": "255987654321",
  "address": "456 Updated Street, Dar es Salaam"
}

### 10. Partial update counter party
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties/1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

### 11. Delete contract counter party
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### 12. Test validation errors - missing required fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact_person": "John Doe"
}

### 13. Test validation errors - invalid phone format
POST {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Company",
  "email": "test@company.com",
  "phone": "123456789"
}

### 14. Test validation errors - invalid email
POST {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Company",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "phone": "255123456789"
}

### 15. Test validation errors - no contact method
POST {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Company",
  "contact_person": "John Doe",
  "address": "123 Street"
}

### 16. Test authorization - without token
GET {{baseUrl}}/contract-counter-parties

